<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>AutoPilot Assist for GTA </Major>
    <Description>This file automates basic pilot controls in GTA Emerald OG to make flying planes easier and faster.  
It automatically presses "E" to enter the pilot seat, holds "W" to accelerate, and repeatedly presses "E" when reaching the mission's drop-off point.  
The player no longer needs to manually press keys during standard take-off and drop sequences — just fly over the target area and the script handles the rest.</Description>
    <Comment># AutoPilot Assist for GTA Emerald OG
# 
# This script helps players fly planes more easily by automating key actions.
# - Presses "E" to enter the pilot seat.
# - Holds "W" to accelerate continuously.
# - Repeatedly presses "E" when flying over the drop-off zone.
# 
# Designed to save time and reduce manual input during missions.
# Simply activate and enjoy smoother flights!</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 8 1
Delay 91 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 580 ms
KeyDown 82 1
Delay 90 ms
KeyUp 82 1
Delay 809 ms
KeyDown 88 1
Delay 73 ms
KeyUp 88 1
Delay 1026 ms
KeyDown 23 1
Delay 85 ms
KeyUp 23 1
Delay 2368 ms
KeyDown 56 1
Delay 79 ms
KeyUp 56 1
Delay 1027 ms
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 78 ms
